<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Privacy Policy — Finance Manager</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container wide">
    <div class="card">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Finance Manager stores the account information you provide (name, email) and the transactions you add, in order to show your income/expense dashboard. We do not sell or share your data with third parties.</p>
      <p>If you sign in with Google, we receive your name and email address from Google to create your account — we do not access your Gmail inbox or any other Google data.</p>
      <p>We use Google's Gmail API solely to send account emails from the app's own sender address (email verification links and password-reset links) — this permission does not let the app read, send from, or access your personal Gmail account.</p>
      <p>You can delete your account and data at any time by contacting the app owner.</p>
      <p class="muted">Replace this page with your own policy before publishing for real users — this is placeholder text sufficient to pass Google's OAuth verification review.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
